  "title": "Government-wide asset and benefit obligation schedule",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Government-wide asset and benefit obligation schedule</h2><p>Prepare the specified government-wide measurements and identify a fund-level difference.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m3-tbs6-f1\">Equipment carrying amount</label><input id=\"bar-m3-tbs6-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m3-tbs6-f2\">Net pension liability</label><input id=\"bar-m3-tbs6-f2\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m3-tbs6-f3\">Relationship of annual contribution to expense</label><select id=\"bar-m3-tbs6-f3\"><option value=\"They are not necessarily equal\">They are not necessarily equal</option><option value=\"They are always identical\">They are always identical</option><option value=\"Contributions are always revenue\">Contributions are always revenue</option><option value=\"Expense is never recognized\">Expense is never recognized</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m3-tbs6-f4\">Government-wide treatment of qualifying capital outlay</label><select id=\"bar-m3-tbs6-f4\"><option value=\"Capitalize and apply subsequent asset accounting\">Capitalize and apply subsequent asset accounting</option><option value=\"Always expense the entire outlay again\">Always expense the entire outlay again</option><option value=\"Ignore the asset\">Ignore the asset</option><option value=\"Record all outlays as pension expense\">Record all outlays as pension expense</option></select></div></section>",
